msgid "Allowed (GLPI default behavior)"
msgstr "Allowed (GLPI default behavior)"

msgid "Block solution approval when there is a comment"
msgstr "Block solution approval when there is a comment"

msgid "Comments during solution approval"
msgstr "Comments during solution approval"

msgid "Configuration saved successfully."
msgstr "Configuration saved successfully."

msgid "Error saving configuration."
msgstr "Error saving configuration."

msgid ""
"It is not allowed to enter comments when approving a solution. Please leave "
"the text box empty or refuse the solution."
msgstr ""
"It is not allowed to enter comments when approving a solution. Please leave "
"the text box empty or refuse the solution."

msgid "Show warning to the user, allowing the solution approval"
msgstr "Show warning to the user, allowing the solution approval"

msgid "Solution Approval Guard"
msgstr "Solution Approval Guard"

msgid "Show a warning to the user, allowing approval only after additional confirmation"
msgstr "Show a warning to the user, allowing approval only after additional confirmation"

msgid "Confirm approval with a comment"
msgstr "Confirm approval with a comment"

msgid "You are about to approve the solution while leaving a comment."
msgstr "You are about to approve the solution while leaving a comment."

msgid "If the problem is not resolved, cancel and use Refuse instead."
msgstr "If the problem is not resolved, cancel and use Refuse instead."

msgid "Approve anyway"
msgstr "Approve anyway"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Cancel"

msgid "Solution Approval Settings"
msgstr "Solution Approval Settings"

msgid "Solution approved"
msgstr "Solution approved"

msgid ""
"Warning: Your solution was approved, but to report pending issues you must "
"refuse the solution or open a new ticket."
msgstr ""
"Warning: Your solution was approved, but to report pending issues you must "
"refuse the solution or open a new ticket."

msgid "Approval with a comment is allowed immediately. A warning is displayed after submission to explain that pending issues should be reported by refusing the solution or opening a new ticket. No additional confirmation is requested and approval is not blocked."
msgstr "Approval with a comment is allowed immediately. A warning is displayed after submission to explain that pending issues should be reported by refusing the solution or opening a new ticket. No additional confirmation is requested and approval is not blocked."

msgid "Approval is blocked on the server when the comment contains text. To approve, the user must clear the comment; if the problem persists, they should refuse the solution instead. Empty HTML tags and spaces alone are not considered a comment."
msgstr "Approval is blocked on the server when the comment contains text. To approve, the user must clear the comment; if the problem persists, they should refuse the solution instead. Empty HTML tags and spaces alone are not considered a comment."

msgid "When the user approves a solution with a comment, a confirmation dialog is displayed before submission. Approve anyway continues the approval with the comment. Cancel, Escape or closing the dialog keeps the comment without submitting the approval. If the problem persists, the user should cancel and refuse the solution instead. Empty comments do not require additional confirmation."
msgstr "When the user approves a solution with a comment, a confirmation dialog is displayed before submission. Approve anyway continues the approval with the comment. Cancel, Escape or closing the dialog keeps the comment without submitting the approval. If the problem persists, the user should cancel and refuse the solution instead. Empty comments do not require additional confirmation."
